<section image-layout="blank" id="5eNqILnn-0" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="6XcDyb3DBT"><h2>Minimum evidence for an investable transition plan</h2><p>Run all four checks; then use evidence completeness and potential materiality to set the gate.</p><grid spacing="large" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="P4ijkQsSmf" colspan="36"><h3>Minimum evidence pack</h3><grid divider="sm neutral-border" marker="number" marker-style="subtle" marker-shape="rounded" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" direction="vertical" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-inline-size: 30pt; --marker-gap: 12pt;"><grid-item id="wgB2vofDtQ" padding="8pt 0"><p>Inventory by substance, equipment, location, age and ownership.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="JVC6ukYf6M" padding="8pt 0"><p>Leak, maintenance, servicing, recovery and disposal records.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="wmAecjJt2i" padding="8pt 0"><p>Replacement schedule, approved capex, suppliers and technician capacity.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Q7enDgMmgD" padding="8pt 0"><p>Scenario ownership and board-level accountability.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="Lryg7gN9ea" colspan="24"><h3>Evidence-to-action gate</h3><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="ntMtt8OYtb" background-color="palette-3" padding="13pt 16pt"><h4>Underwrite</h4><p>All four checks reconcile and the response is funded.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="MwqmF4eVQM" background-color="palette-1" padding="13pt 16pt"><h4>Reserve + engage</h4><p>Gaps are bounded, priceable and assigned to a named owner.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="QPfe3gVk_5" background-color="palette-2" padding="13pt 16pt"><h4>Defer</h4><p>A potentially material exposure remains unclassified or unfunded.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>